, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "At the door, she rips it open.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Cold night air rushes in.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Red and blue lights flash across the lot.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Sirens rise.", "para": 13, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Valentin stops in the middle of the aisle.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "He lowers his gun slowly, looking at the lights.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}